
mine dock-seed
  mine any
    mine form, like dock-seed-code
      site code
    mine form, like dock-seed-policy
      site policy

mine dock-seed-code
  mine term, term seed
    mine term, term code
      mine list
        mine form, like dock-seed-code-case
          site case

